# Copy this file to .privacy-terms (same folder). .privacy-terms is git-ignored and is NEVER committed.
# One entry per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# A plain line is a case-insensitive text match:
#   placeholder street name
# Wrap a line in slashes to make it a regular expression (flags allowed after the last slash):
#   /placeholder\s+lane/i
#
# What belongs here: your own street address and town, your name, phone number, client or
# company names, anything that must never appear in this repo. These lines are examples only.
example-private-term
/example\s+regex\s+term/i
